== Usage ==
This template creates a green area infobox. Fields are displayed only when their parameters are supplied.

<pre>
{{Area infobox
 | name = Example Area
 | type = Area
 | district = District 1
 | tower_count = 12
 | status = Released
 | description = A brief, verified summary.
}}
</pre>

Parameters:
* name — heading; defaults to the current page title.
* type, district, tower_count, status, description — optional area details.

This template uses the #if parser function, which requires the MediaWiki ParserFunctions extension. Preview it in a sandbox before using it on live pages.
